{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39395","headline":"捣练篇 · 韦庄","name":"捣练篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月华吐艳明烛烛，青楼妇唱捣衣曲。\n白袷丝光织鱼目，菱花绶带鸳鸯簇。\n临风缥缈叠秋雪，月下丁冬捣寒玉。\n楼兰欲寄在何乡，凭人与系征鸿足。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}